cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Cascade in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "Cascade: a web UI for rtorrent"
abstract: >-
  Cascade is a web UI for the rtorrent BitTorrent client, shipped as one Docker image
  with rtorrent compiled from source inside. A Go server talks XML-RPC to rtorrent over
  SCGI and streams the state to every open page as a snapshot followed by deltas over
  server-sent events; the same server and React UI work with any rtorrent from 0.9.8 to
  0.16.x by probing which commands the running one implements.
authors:
  - given-names: Johan
    family-names: Lindvall
repository-code: "https://github.com/JohanLindvall/Cascade"
url: "https://github.com/JohanLindvall/Cascade"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - rtorrent
  - BitTorrent
  - torrent client
  - web UI
  - Docker
  - self-hosted
  - server-sent events
  - XML-RPC
